# Curated Eclipse 4.41 (2026-09) RCP target platform from Maven Central.
# Only the bundles an E3/E4 RCP product needs, on purpose without test frameworks
# (JUnit, osgi-test, Mockito, Hamcrest, AssertJ), so the library does not change
# what the rest of a consumer workspace resolves (see issue #14).
# Keep the versions in sync with the Eclipse release the templates are resolved against.

